  "bug_description": "Remote static icons delay a normal cold-cache forecast launch. Both variants use the same ordinary forecast fixture; unfixed downloads identical icon bytes with a declared four-second image-response delay, while fixed loads bundled images. This does not claim the original weather provider key works or a warm-cache speedup.",
